---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout active="lab" title="STRIV Lab — Pustaka Edukasi Gratis." description="Movement database, artikel edukasi science-based, dan template workout gratis dari STRIV Surabaya.">

<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <img class="hero-mark" src="/symbol_logo.svg" alt="STRIV" width="64" height="64" fetchpriority="high" />
  <span class="eyebrow">[STRIV LAB] | REAL SCIENCE, GRATIS</span>
  <h1>Belajar Dulu.<br /><em>Baru Angkat.</em></h1>
  <p>Pustaka edukasi terstruktur: video teknik gerakan fundamental, artikel pematah mitos, dan template siap pakai. Semua gratis.</p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-lime" href="#movement">Movement Database <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#download"><Icon name="clipboard-check" size={16} /> Download Template</a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- MASTER BOOK -->
<section id="masterbook" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="final-box">
    <img src="/symbol_logo.svg" alt="STRIV" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" style="margin:0 auto 1rem;display:block" />
    <span class="eyebrow">[STRIV MASTER BOOK // EDISI PUBLIK // COMING SOON]</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Semua Ilmu Lab, dalam 1 Buku.</h2>
    <p>34 video + 50 artikel + 18 jurnal diringkas jadi e-book publik siap jual. Dapatkan akses pertama saat rilis.</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="margin-bottom:0">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-lime" data-book-open>Dapatkan Master Book <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16} /></button>
    </div>
    <div class="micro">[EDISI PUBLIK • GRATIS PREVIEW SAAT RILIS]</div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<dialog class="bookdlg" id="bookdlg" aria-labelledby="bookdlg-title">
  <div class="dlg-in">
    <button type="button" class="dlg-x" data-book-close aria-label="Tutup">×</button>
    <img src="/symbol_logo.svg" alt="STRIV" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" style="margin:0 auto;display:block" />
    <h3 id="bookdlg-title">Dapatkan Master Book</h3>
    <p>E-book <b>Edisi Publik</b> untuk semua level — bukunya sama, pendampingannya yang beda.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-lime" href="/coaching"><Icon name="dumbbell" size={16} /> Gabung Coaching</a>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" disabled style="opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed">[COMING SOON] Beli E-Book Publik</button>
    <div class="micro">EDISI PUBLIK • E-BOOK TERPISAH SEGERA HADIR</div>
  </div>
</dialog>

<!-- FONDASI RISET -->
<section id="data" style="padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center"><span class="eyebrow">[DATA BERBICARA]</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Angka Tidak Berbohong.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Scroll pelan-pelan. Empat temuan riset yang jadi alasan STRIV ada — semua dengan sumber resmi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="story">
    <figure class="story-visual" data-active="0" style="margin:0">
      <div class="spanel" data-p="0"><span class="snum">±50%</span><Icon name="users" size={30} /><span class="slabel">member baru berhenti dalam 6 bulan pertama</span><span class="ssample">[STUDI n=441 • IHRSA 1,5JT]</span></div>
      <div class="spanel" data-p="1"><span class="snum">−66%</span><Icon name="shield-check" size={30} /><span class="slabel">risiko cedera dengan strength training terstruktur</span><span class="ssample">[META-ANALISIS n=7.738]</span></div>
      <div class="spanel" data-p="2"><span class="snum">&lt;1</span><Icon name="dumbbell" size={30} /><span class="slabel">cedera per 1.000 jam traditional strength training</span><span class="ssample">[REVIEW 2023 • TERAMAN]</span></div>
      <div class="spanel" data-p="3"><span class="snum">SUP&gt;P</span><Icon name="clipboard-check" size={30} /><span class="slabel">latihan terbimbing mengalahkan latihan mandiri</span><span class="ssample">[META-ANALISIS 12 STUDI]</span></div>
      <div class="sdots" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sdot" data-d="0"></span><span class="sdot" data-d="1"></span><span class="sdot" data-d="2"></span><span class="sdot" data-d="3"></span></div>
    </figure>
    <div class="story-steps">
      <article class="sstep" data-s="0"><span class="stag">[TEMUAN 01]</span><h3>Separuh member baru menyerah sebelum 6 bulan.</h3><p>Bukan karena malas. Studi 441 member menunjukkan minimnya arahan bikin orang berhenti. Data IHRSA (1,5 juta member): 47,5% membatalkan membership, dan usia 16–24 tahun hanya 37% yang bertahan 24 bulan.</p><a class="src" href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5094673/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hooker et al. 2016, PMC ↗</a> <a class="src" href="https://www.fittechglobal.com/fit-tech-features/IHRSA-update-One-million-strong/30115" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IHRSA One Million Strong ↗</a></article>
      <article class="sstep" data-s="1"><span class="stag">[TEMUAN 02]</span><h3>Latihan kekuatan terstruktur memangkas cedera hingga dua pertiga.</h3><p>Meta-analisis 7.738 partisipan: program strength training yang terprogram menurunkan cedera akut dan overuse secara dose-dependent. Makin konsisten dijalankan, makin protektif.</p><a class="src" href="https://bjsm.bmj.com/content/52/24/1557" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lauersen et al. 2018, BJSM ↗</a></article>
      <article class="sstep" data-s="2"><span class="stag">[TEMUAN 03]</span><h3>Traditional strength training = cara teraman angkat beban.</h3><p>Systematic review 2023: angka cedera hanya ~0,24–1 per 1.000 jam, jauh di bawah lari (2–10× lipat) dan sepak bola (6–10 per 1.000 jam). Teknik terkontrol, bukan ego.</p><a class="src" href="https://www.nsca.com/education/articles/ptq/the-safest-and-riskiest-forms-of-resistance-training/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NSCA 2026, ringkasan riset ↗</a></article>
      <article class="sstep" data-s="3"><span class="stag">[TEMUAN 04]</span><h3>Didampingi coach hasilnya lebih besar.</h3><p>Meta-analisis: latihan dengan supervisi menghasilkan kenaikan kekuatan lebih besar dibanding latihan mandiri. Mayoritas cedera bermula dari teknik yang buruk dan tanpa pendampingan yang qualified.</p><a class="src" href="https://journal.iusca.org/index.php/Journal/article/view/101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fisher et al. 2022, IUSCA ↗</a> <a class="src" href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3483033/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Faigenbaum, PMC ↗</a></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- MOVEMENT DATABASE -->
<section id="movement"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center"><span class="eyebrow">[MOVEMENT DATABASE // 34 VIDEO]</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">Tonton. Tiru. Kuasai.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Tutorial internasional + lokal dari coach &amp; channel kredibel — klik untuk putar. Kredit penuh ke pembuatnya.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="vtoolbar" id="vtoolbar"><div class="vbar-in">
    <input type="search" id="vsearch" placeholder="Cari video… (mis. squat, protein, Ade Rai)" aria-label="Cari video" autocomplete="off" />
    <div class="vpills" role="group" aria-label="Filter kategori">
      <button type="button" class="vpill on" data-fcat="all">Semua</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="squat">Squat</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="deadlift">Deadlift</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="bench">Bench</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="presspull">Press &amp; Pull</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="hinge">Hinge &amp; Glute</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="bodyweight">Bodyweight</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-fcat="lokal">Lokal ID</button>
    </div>
    <div class="vpills" role="group" aria-label="Filter bahasa">
      <button type="button" class="vpill on" data-flang="all">Semua Bahasa</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-flang="id">Indonesia</button><button type="button" class="vpill" data-flang="en">English</button>
    </div>
    <div class="vcount" id="vcount" aria-live="polite"></div>
</div></div>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="vempty" id="vempty" hidden>
    <p>Tidak ada video yang cocok. Coba kata kunci atau filter lain.</p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="vreset">Reset Filter</button>
